license: Apache-2.0
version: 0.2.0
abstract: >-
  A Lean 4 and mathlib library for foundational finite causal-set order theory,
  finite non-identifiability examples, exact deterministic identities for
  permutation-generated two-orders, and labelled correspondence distances.
keywords:
  - Lean
  - causal sets
  - order theory
  - formalized mathematics
  - labelled correspondences
